OL,3,GNEWSANeighbour driveway row costs
OL,4,Aglampsite owner #135k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA glampsite owner is challenging a
OL,7,Fcourt order to pay #135,000 in legal
OL,8,Fcosts after she tried to block her
OL,9,Fneighbours from parking their car in
OL,10,Ftheir own garden.
OL,12,FCarol Esteban told her neighbours Neil
OL,13,Fand Nadine Gould that their right to
OL,14,Fuse their shared driveway ended
OL,15,Fopposite their front door, which would
OL,16,Fblock them from their parking space.
OL,18,FBoth sides accused the other of
OL,19,Ftrespassing, while Esteban was accused
OL,20,Fof using "boulders" to block the
OL,21,Fcouple's access to the shared track.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
